{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Cadence Video Player 是一款原生影片播放器，適用於 Mac、iPhone、iPad 及 Apple TV，可直接指向本機資料夾或 NAS 並即時播放，無需訂閱、廣告或帳戶。它適合把影片收藏整理在 NAS、重視檔案原貌的用戶，打開資料夾就能按播放。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-55.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>原生播放器全面支援各格式</h2>\n<p>支援 MKV、MP4、MOV、TS、AVI 及 WebM 等常見格式，涵蓋 H.264、HEVC、AV1 及 VP9 編碼，DTS、TrueHD、FLAC、Opus 等音軌由 App 自行解碼。它會按內建喇叭、耳機、AirPlay 或擴音機分別混音，並設對白音量控制。文字與圖形字幕可直接從檔案讀取，字體、顏色與大小皆可自訂，並自動選用你慣用的語言。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2778x1284bb-9-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-298-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-299-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-300-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2778x1284bb-10-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-301-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Cadence Video Player</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/cadence-video-player/id6811436590?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:23:28.284339+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":404,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T20:19:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T12:58:18.518616+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:48.874075+00:00","content_hash":"7b4695ae4bd653ab7d52d6d786ecce5edce47a1500aa3e7c304a787b7ec14675","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}